{"supplier":"hotelbeds","supplierHotelId":"879823","name":"Belle Epoque Suites Athens","description":"A stay at Belle epoque suites places you in the heart of Athens, within a 15-minute walk of Syntagma Square and Ancient Agora of Athens. This 4-star hotel is 0. 7 mi (1. 2 km) from Temple of Olympian Zeus and 1. 5 mi (2. 5 km) from Acropolis. Take in the views from a terrace and make use of amenities such as complimentary wireless Internet access and tour/ticket assistance. Featured amenities include luggage storage, a safe deposit box at the front desk, and an elevator. Make yourself at home in one of the 17 air-conditioned rooms featuring minibars and espresso makers. Flat-screen televisions with cable programming provide entertainment, while complimentary wireless Internet access keeps you connected. Private bathrooms with showers feature complimentary toiletries and hair dryers. Conveniences include safes and coffee/tea makers, and housekeeping is provided daily.","address":"Praxitelous, 7","city":"Athens","countryCode":"GR","postalCode":"105 62","lat":37.97802799999999,"lng":23.7307059,"giataCode":"1281823","phone":"+302107000314","email":"info@belleepoquesuites.gr","website":"https://belleepoquesuites.gr/","images":[{"url":"https://photos.hotelbeds.com/giata/bigger/87/879823/879823a_hb_a_006.jpg","category":"exterior","order":0},{"url":"https://photos.hotelbeds.com/giata/bigger/87/879823/879823a_hb_a_013.JPG","category":"exterior","order":1},{"url":"https://photos.hotelbeds.com/giata/bigger/87/879823/879823a_hb_a_010.jpg","category":"exterior","order":2},{"url":"https://photos.hotelbeds.com/giata/bigger/87/879823/879823a_hb_a_026.jpg","category":"exterior","order":3},{"url":"https://photos.hotelbeds.com/giata/bigger/87/879823/879823a_hb_a_027.jpg","category":"exterior","order":4},{"url":"https://photos.hotelbeds.com/giata/bigger/87/879823/879823a_hb_a_028.jpg","category":"exterior","order":5},{"url":"https://photos.hotelbeds.com/giata/bigger/87/879823/879823a_